#: ../../api-reference.md:3
msgid "API reference"
msgstr "Marejeleo ya API"

#: ../../api-reference.md:5
msgid ""
"This page is generated from the OpenAPI file, which is exported from the "
"service code. When the API changes, this page changes with it."
msgstr ""
"Ukurasa huu unatengenezwa kutoka kwenye faili la OpenAPI, ambalo hutolewa "
"kutoka kwenye msimbo wa huduma. API inapobadilika, ukurasa huu hubadilika "
"pamoja nayo."

#: ../../api-reference.md:7
msgid ""
"All endpoints except `/health` need an API key. See "
"[Authentication](authentication.md)."
msgstr ""
"Endpoints zote isipokuwa `/health` zinahitaji API key. Tazama "
"[Uthibitishaji](authentication.md)."

#: ../../api-reference.md:9
msgid "POST /v1/generate"
msgstr "POST /v1/generate"

#: ../../api-reference.md:11
msgid "**Generate text**"
msgstr "**Tengeneza maandishi**"

#: ../../api-reference.md:13
msgid ""
"Sends a prompt to a model and returns the response. The response includes"
" an X-Data-Region header that echoes the region that processed the "
"request."
msgstr ""
"Inatuma prompt kwa model na kurudisha jibu. Jibu linajumuisha kichwa cha "
"X-Data-Region kinachoonyesha eneo lililochakata ombi."

#: ../../api-reference.md:15 ../../api-reference.md:74
#: ../../api-reference.md:104
msgid "Requires an API key."
msgstr "Inahitaji API key."

#: ../../api-reference.md:17 ../../api-reference.md:106
msgid "Request body"
msgstr "Mwili wa ombi"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Field"
msgstr "Sehemu"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Aina"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Required"
msgstr "Inahitajika"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Maelezo"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`model`"
msgstr "`model`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "string"
msgstr "string"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Ndiyo"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "ID of the model to use. List them with GET /v1/models."
msgstr "ID ya model ya kutumia. Ziorodheshe kwa GET /v1/models."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`prompt`"
msgstr "`prompt`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The text you want the model to respond to. Length 1 to 4000 characters."
msgstr "Maandishi unayotaka model ijibu. Urefu wa herufi 1 hadi 4000."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`language`"
msgstr "`language`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "No"
msgstr "Hapana"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid ""
"Language code of the prompt. Each model supports a different set. "
"Default: `\"en\"`."
msgstr ""
"Msimbo wa lugha wa prompt. Kila model inatumia seti tofauti. "
"Chaguomsingi: `\"en\"`."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`max_tokens`"
msgstr "`max_tokens`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "integer"
msgstr "integer"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid ""
"Upper limit on tokens in the response. Cannot exceed the model's "
"max_output_tokens. Default: `64`. Minimum 1."
msgstr ""
"Kikomo cha juu cha tokeni katika jibu. Hakiwezi kuzidi "
"`max_output_tokens` ya model. Chaguomsingi: `64`. Kiwango cha chini: 1."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`region`"
msgstr "`region`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Where the request is processed: ke, ug, ma or mu. Default: `\"ke\"`."
msgstr ""
"Ombi linachakatwa katika: ke, ug, ma au mu. Chaguomsingi: `\"ke\"`."

#: ../../api-reference.md:27 ../../api-reference.md:112
msgid "Example request body:"
msgstr "Mfano wa mwili wa ombi:"

#: ../../api-reference.md:39 ../../api-reference.md:76
#: ../../api-reference.md:120 ../../api-reference.md:145
msgid "Responses"
msgstr "Majibu"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Hali"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Maana"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "200"
msgstr "200"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The generated text and token usage."
msgstr "Maandishi yaliyotengenezwa na matumizi ya tokeni."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "400"
msgstr "400"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The request was invalid. Check the message field."
msgstr "Ombi si sahihi. Angalia sehemu ya message."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "401"
msgstr "401"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The API key is missing or not valid."
msgstr "API key haipo au si sahihi."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "404"
msgstr "404"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The model or endpoint does not exist."
msgstr "Model au endpoint haipo."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "429"
msgstr "429"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid ""
"Rate limit exceeded. Wait for the number of seconds in the Retry-After "
"header."
msgstr ""
"Kikomo cha maombi kimezidiwa. Subiri idadi ya sekunde iliyo kwenye "
"kichwa cha Retry-After."

#: ../../api-reference.md:49 ../../api-reference.md:84
#: ../../api-reference.md:129 ../../api-reference.md:151
msgid "A `200` response has these fields."
msgstr "Jibu la `200` lina sehemu hizi."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`id`"
msgstr "`id`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Unique ID for this generation."
msgstr "ID ya kipekee ya utengenezaji huu."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The model that handled the request."
msgstr "Model iliyoshughulikia ombi."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The language code you sent."
msgstr "Msimbo wa lugha uliotuma."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`output`"
msgstr "`output`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The generated text."
msgstr "Maandishi yaliyotengenezwa."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`finish_reason`"
msgstr "`finish_reason`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "string, one of `stop`, `length`"
msgstr "string, mojawapo ya `stop`, `length`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid ""
"stop means the response ended naturally. length means it was cut off at "
"max_tokens."
msgstr ""
"`stop` inamaanisha jibu liliisha kwa kawaida. `length` inamaanisha "
"lilisimamishwa kwenye `max_tokens`."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`usage`"
msgstr "`usage`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Usage object"
msgstr "Kipengee cha matumizi"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Token counts for this request."
msgstr "Idadi ya tokeni za ombi hili."

#: ../../api-reference.md:60
msgid "The `usage` object has these fields."
msgstr "Kipengee cha `usage` kina sehemu hizi."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`prompt_tokens`"
msgstr "`prompt_tokens`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Tokens in the prompt."
msgstr "Tokeni katika prompt."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`completion_tokens`"
msgstr "`completion_tokens`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Tokens in the response."
msgstr "Tokeni katika jibu."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`total_tokens`"
msgstr "`total_tokens`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "prompt_tokens plus completion_tokens."
msgstr "`prompt_tokens` pamoja na `completion_tokens`."

#: ../../api-reference.md:68 ../../api-reference.md:98
#: ../../api-reference.md:137
msgid "Failures use the standard error body described in [Errors](errors.md)."
msgstr ""
"Hitilafu hutumia mwili wa kawaida wa hitilafu ulioelezwa katika "
"[Hitilafu](errors.md)."

#: ../../api-reference.md:70
msgid "GET /v1/models"
msgstr "GET /v1/models"

#: ../../api-reference.md:72
msgid "**List models**"
msgstr "**Orodhesha model**"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The models you can use."
msgstr "Model unazoweza kutumia."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`data`"
msgstr "`data`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "array of ModelInfo object"
msgstr "array ya vitu vya ModelInfo"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The available models."
msgstr "Model zinazopatikana."

#: ../../api-reference.md:90
msgid "Each item in `data` has these fields."
msgstr "Kila kipengee katika `data` kina sehemu hizi."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Model ID. Pass this as model when you generate text."
msgstr "ID ya model. Pitisha hii kama `model` unapotengeneza maandishi."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`max_output_tokens`"
msgstr "`max_output_tokens`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Largest max_tokens value this model accepts."
msgstr "Thamani kubwa zaidi ya `max_tokens` inayokubaliwa na model hii."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`languages`"
msgstr "`languages`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "array of string"
msgstr "array ya string"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Language codes this model accepts."
msgstr "Misimbo ya lugha inayokubaliwa na model hii."

#: ../../api-reference.md:100
msgid "POST /v1/tokens/count"
msgstr "POST /v1/tokens/count"

#: ../../api-reference.md:102
msgid "**Count tokens**"
msgstr "**Hesabu tokeni**"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`text`"
msgstr "`text`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Text to count tokens for. Length 1 to 20000 characters."
msgstr "Maandishi ya kuhesabu tokeni. Urefu wa herufi 1 hadi 20000."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The token count for the text."
msgstr "Idadi ya tokeni katika maandishi."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`token_count`"
msgstr "`token_count`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Number of tokens in the text."
msgstr "Idadi ya tokeni katika maandishi."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`word_count`"
msgstr "`word_count`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Number of words in the text, split on whitespace."
msgstr "Idadi ya maneno katika maandishi, yakigawanywa kwa nafasi."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`tokens_per_word`"
msgstr "`tokens_per_word`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "number"
msgstr "number"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "token_count divided by word_count, rounded to two decimals."
msgstr "`token_count` imegawanywa kwa `word_count`, na kuzungushwa hadi desimali mbili."

#: ../../api-reference.md:139
msgid "GET /health"
msgstr "GET /health"

#: ../../api-reference.md:141
msgid "**Check service health**"
msgstr "**Angalia hali ya huduma**"

#: ../../api-reference.md:143
msgid "No API key needed."
msgstr "Hakuna API key inayohitajika."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The service is running."
msgstr "Huduma inaendelea kufanya kazi."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`status`"
msgstr "`status`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Always ok when the service is running."
msgstr "Daima ni `ok` wakati huduma inaendelea kufanya kazi."